!Series_summary = Analysis of RNA expression in LNCaP prostate cancer cells treated with different siRNAs to define the regulatory effect of HNRNPL and LARP on RNA expression.
!Series_overall_design = LNCaP prostate cancer cells were treated with the control siRNA oligos and the siRNA oligos that knockdown the expression of HNRNPL and LARP. The polyA-RNA expression difference upon different siRNA oligo treatment was evaluted.
